 gone out  the vaccination program will pick up  pace as we go into  january but i've also said that there  will be times because we are still in  this pandemic  where the light will be difficult to see  that's the stage we're at right now we  can't see the light at the moment it's  obscured  because of this difficult phase but it  hasn't gone out  it is still there we do have brighter  times ahead  but in order to get us safely or as  safely as possible to those brighter  times  i need to ask you for more sacrifices  for a period  thank you so much for listening the  chief medical officer is going to say a  few words  then the national clinical director and  then we are going to take some questions  from journalists  as normal

